window.products.push({"id":176036,"name":"KPBLIS Weighted Blanket with Cover 15 lbs 48\" x 72\" for 130-170 lbs, Heavy Blanket with Smaller Pockets, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zu3Yb2PUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kpblis weighted blanket set Thank you very much for your interest in knowing Kpblis factory. We are a home textile company specializing in the home textile production industry for more than 20 years, specializing in the design and production of various foreign trade textile products for 18 years. Kpblis weighted blanket is made of soft 100% cotton fabric and eco-friendly glass beads using advanced quilting technology. There are no problems such as quilting cracking and glass bead leakage. You can rest assured on our service and quality. Perfect sleep Are you still anxious about difficult fall asleep late at night? Don't hesitate to use Kpblis weighted blanket, soft and breathable fabric, comfortable skin-like touch, weighted hug, and advanced quilting to make you easy and quiet to fall asleep. How to choose the right weighted blanket We recommend that you choose the blanket that weighs about 8% to 12% of your body weight. After determining the weight of the blanket, you can choose the size according to your preference. Instructions 1. Children under 5 years old and pregnant women are not recommended. Older people should ensure that they can open aggravated blankets independently. 2. Weighted blankets should not cross the shoulders and should not cover the head. 3. Machine washable on gentle cycle with cold water or hand wash or dry clean. 4. Regularly check the heavy blanket for damage to prevent internal material leakage. Don't swallow the contents of the blanket. Satisfaction guarantee Kpblis weighted blanket provides exclusive 1 year warranty. If it is damaged during use, please don't hesitate to contact us and we will free mending it for you. (shipping fee not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zu3Yb2PUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kpblis","source_asin":"B081L8KSYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-176036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081L8KSYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081L8KSYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
