window.products.push({"id":176093,"name":"Ceramic Tea Bowl Cup Chawan Clay Teacup Eggshell Glaze Chinese Teaware Stoneware (white, brown, 3.4 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ofLU8E0jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This footed tea bowl will enhance your tea drinking experience whether you will use it for a tea ceremony or on a daily basis. The brown inner glaze makes a fine contrast to precious green, white or yellow tea. The thick glazed walls perfectly retain the heat, but stay pleasantly warm outside and won’t scald your fingers while you're savoring delicious tea brew. This tea bowl was manufactured in Henan province of China famous for its ancient traditions of pottery. Tea is a wonderful beverage which is enjoyed all over the world and there are a lot of ceremonies in all parts of Asia for drinking and preparing the tea. This lovely tradition came to us from China where the tea was first used as a medicine. According to the legend, one of the rulers in the ancient China was looking for medical cures and got poisoned. And a drop of water from the tea tree saved him. So it is only prudent and just that Asian and especially Chinese ceramics and porcelain teaware are considered to be the first choice when it comes to taking a break from the mundane to drink a cup of Oolong or Rooibos. Or a couple. Our company “Pacific tea” is based in Hong Kong and strictly follows old traditions of tea culture. We have been wholesaling tea and teaware for about 130 years all over the world. Among our customers, there are Chinese communities and restaurants, tea clubs and embassies. We are proud of the tea tradition in China, and eager to show people the difference between ordinary tea drinking and savouring each drop of the precious liquor in the best Asian style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ofLU8E0jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacific Tea","source_asin":"B01MPZA7HA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-176093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MPZA7HA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MPZA7HA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
