window.products.push({"id":176189,"name":"Press Pasta Machine - kitchen hand pressure noodle pressing - Stainless Steel Manual Noodles Press Machine Pasta Maker with 7 Noodle Mould","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61re3Usj-7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Material: stainless steel Color: Grey & Orange Weight:600g/1.3lb Function: Kitchen & Bar Dimensions: 18 x 14 x 6 cm  Package include: 1 x Noodle Press Machine 7 x Noodle Mould  How to operate it and making delicious noodle 1. Knead dough with water to make it soft. (Add some edible oil would be better.) 2. Unscrew the cover and put the dough, vegetable or have cut fruits into the drum, then screw the handle and noodle or juice will come out. (this machine is also can press juice, two functions.) 3. Put the bottom of machine close to water for easy coming out. 4. After usage, disassemble it and wash with water. Or soaking it in the water later, it is more easy to clean. Then dry and put in your cabinet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61re3Usj-7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TaoXiong","source_asin":"B07X6SJLVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-176189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X6SJLVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X6SJLVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
