window.products.push({"id":176282,"name":"Pristine Luxury Pillow Cover, Soft, Breathable Pillow Protector / Encasement, Protects Against Dust and Other Irritants, Made in The USA (Queen)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ennVvNYIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pristine Luxury pillow covers are made with a special 100% polyester Pristine fabric that has one of the smallest pore sizes in the industry. With such a small pore size, pet dander, dust and other irritants are unable to pass through the fabric providing you with complete protection. No \"membrane\" on the back of the fabric gives you a cool, smooth, breathable feeling that you normally only get with your best sheets! Pristine pillow protectors are totally breathable, which means no added heat for your body.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ennVvNYIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BARGOOSE HOME TEXTILES, INC.","source_asin":"B09T8TCLY9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-176282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T8TCLY9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T8TCLY9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":176283,"name":"Bush Furniture Salinas Entryway Storage Set with Hall Tree, Shoe Bench and Accent Cabinet, Driftwood Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":354.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nhhrX5qtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Use the Bush Furniture Entryway Storage Set with Hall Tree, Shoe Bench and Accent Cabinet to create a warm, welcoming environment right inside your front door. Timeless Mission style designs feature tapered legs, curved base rails and eye-catching vertical lines to complement today's casual home interiors. Have a seat on the 32W x 16D Bench while putting on and taking off your shoes, or use the spacious surface to set bags down while you get comfortable. Four cubby spaces with two adjustable shelves provide plenty of room to organize footwear, keeping your mudroom free of unnecessary clutter. The Hall Tree attaches to the top of the Shoe Bench and adds three double prong hooks for hanging coats, scarves and hats. The Accent Cabinet includes two doors for concealed storage as well as a central compartment that's perfect for displaying your favorite decorations. Two adjustable shelves, one behind each door, accommodate items of various sizes while the 46W x 13D top surface offers an ideal place to brighten up the room with photos, plants and more. Available in your choice of seven attractive finishes with decorative wood detailing and Tumbled Pewter hardware, this furniture set also works well in a living room or hallway to expand your home furnishings with the relaxed style of a cottage retreat. The entryway organizer with 2 door storage cabinet is backed by the Bush Furniture 1 Year Manufacturer's Warranty. See the full Salinas collection for coordinating items available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nhhrX5qtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B0BXJJMZRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-176283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXJJMZRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXJJMZRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":176284,"name":"Nordic By Nature Large Designer Beach Bag Tote For Women, Men And Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j+pWVI3HL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Neoprene Nylon lining Machine Wash LARGE MULTIFUNCTIONAL BEACH AND POOL BAG: The bags measures 10.5” x 12.5 x 15.5 (27cm x 32cm x 42cm) and includes two big inside pockets, that makes it easy to store your valuables safe and out of sight. Furthermore we added high quality magnets, to create the beautiful designer look, and easy access to the essentials when you need them. It also gives you the option of three different design looks. MADE OF HEAVY DUTY NEOPRENE I BEAUTIFULL COLORS: We designed these bags with the summer, beach and pool in mind. But they can also work as an everyday tote or shopping bag. We made sure the bags are beautiful, durable and functional at the same time. WASHABLE AND EASY TO CLEAN AFTER A TRIP TO THE BEACH: Made from quick drying neoprene, similar to the material wetsuits are made of, it is easy to wash and will last a lifetime. No sand or water will ever break these bags. Just throw it in the washer, or rinse under water, and the bag is as good as new again. WHY NEOPRENE?: The best thing about neoprene is, that it is a tough fabric. You can be sure it won’t rip or wear away. It is also heat, chemical, oil and ozone resistant. Essentially it will stand up to all weather conditions. Rain, hail, sunshine, snow, wind. You name it and neoprene will be able to withstand it. It is also soft, lightweight, flexible and stretchy. The perfect tote for any weather. OPTIONAL LIFELONG WARRANTY: We know you will be happy with this bag. However should it happen, that something is off, we offer a optional lifelong warranty on all manufacturer defects and a no questions asked policy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j+pWVI3HL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nordic By Nature","source_asin":"B07F9QFGHM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-176284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F9QFGHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F9QFGHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
