window.products.push({"id":176454,"name":"Draft Decor Draft Stopper Flue-ZEE Flue Cover (8\" Diameter fits flues up to 6\" Diameter)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BU2W2bxyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dampers in fireplaces do not keep out cold drafts, warm humid summer air and odors. They simply allow air, heat and smoke to go up your chimney flue when there is a fire in your fireplace. When you don't have a fire you have an opening that is costing you heating and cooling dollars. And you have a cold, uncomfortable room as soon as the temperatures drop! Our strong neodymium magnets keep the FLUE-ZEE securely in place. An easy grip handle makes installation and removal a snap! A bright red pendant reminds you the FLUE-ZEE is in place and needs to be removed when starting a fire. All aluminum and steel, except the sealing gasket, the FLUE-ZEE is absolutely the safest way to close and seal your flue, keep out drafts and save money! To install simply center the Flue-zee over your flue opening and let the magnets anchor the FLUE-ZEE into place The gasket will totally seal off your flue keeping out cold drafts, warm humid air, odors, and more! To remove your Flue-zee simply grab the handle and pull to release the magnets. 8\" cover fits flues up to 6\" in diameter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BU2W2bxyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Draft Decor","source_asin":"B07C5VJ4JV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-176454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C5VJ4JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C5VJ4JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
