window.products.push({"id":176471,"name":"3 Piece Mint Flower Bathroom Rug Set Includes Non-Slip Rug, Toilet Lid Cover, Bath Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LDfHyxdYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT 3 PCS BATH RUGS - Includes thickened bathroom mat 31.5\" L × 19.69\" W, O shape toilet lid cover: 16.54\" L × \" 14.57\" W, U shape rug: 20.08\" L × 20.08\" W. Never have you been able to step right out of the bath or shower onto a cloud! Thicker and better constructed than most other brands. Great for bathroom, vanity, vacation home, master bathroom, kids bathroom, guest suite. Please allow 1” or less error due to manual measurement. SUPER ABSORBENT - These upgraded luxurious rugs are made of memory foam and can soak up the water to keep your floor dry. Moisture is trapped in the mat's deep pile, allowing the rug to dry quickly and cleanly. There’s a backing which’s slip resistant on the tile floor surface, so that it won’t slip or slide to keep you more safe and cozy. MACHINE WASHABLE - Wash with cold water and soap. Hang to dry or air dry flat. Do not bleach or dry clean. Tumble dry on low heat or lay to air dry. Color will not fade. Color will stay nice and vibrant for years to come no matter how many times they’ll be washed and dried! MULTI PURPOSE USE - Our non-slip bath rugs are suitable for tub-side, front of the sink, and any place in your home where you want support and relax on your toes! This rug can make a significant difference in the overall color scheme of your bathroom or coordinate with towels and other décor or accessories. CREATE YOUR BATHROOM OASIS - Many different colors and patterns lend a beautiful rich decor element to your bathroom, bringing a charming and fantastic feeling for your family. You will easily find rugs to coordinate with your decor! Due to differences in computer monitors display, there can be slight color variations between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LDfHyxdYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Premium Zone","source_asin":"B08LGJ2N53","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-176471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LGJ2N53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LGJ2N53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
