window.products.push({"id":176533,"name":"Bright Zeal 66 Ft 200 LED Multi Colored Fairy Lights Battery Operated with Remote Timer - 8 Mode Starry String Lights Multicolor Outdoor Waterproof - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gLyJ3I+gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"66 FT 200 LED MULTIFUNCTION MULTICOLOR FAIRY LIGHT - This 66' Ft battery operated fairy string light consists of ONE remote and 4 pack fairy lights, each lined up with 50 mini LEDs aligned in FOUR colors (red yellow green blue) - MULTI COLOR Glow and SILVER COLOR wire bring out a festive fairy feel - The copper wire can be bent into any shape - The REMOTE controls 8 lighting modes, 6hr timer, brightness - Make Your Event or Home Outstanding From Others With This Elegant Fairy Light. 8 POPULAR LIGHTING MODES BY REMOTE OR CONTROLLER - Set the lighting mode and the brightness by remote from EIGHT (8) popular options: Combination, In-wave, Sequential-on, Slo-glo, Chasing/Flash, Slow-fade, Twinkle/Flash, Steady-on - Mode can also be set by the controller button on the battery case - Bendable silver wire and controllable lighting mode and brightness make indoor outdoor decoration possibilities endless, day & night - Take Your Holiday Light Show To The Next Level. WATERPROOF & 6HR TIMER - The copper wire and the mini LED bulbs are waterproof for outdoor and indoor decorations. - Waterproof compact battery box is not really noticeable and easy to decorate. - A 6/18 hours timer can be turned on by remote, allowing to set the light for an automatic glow every day at the same time. - Ideal for events, holidays, bedroom, wedding, parties, shows, etc. ENERGY SAVING & EASY TO INSTALL - Long lasting LED bulbs stay cool to touch after long-time use. - For a new set of batteries, the product lifespan is about 2-3 weeks with the timer on, long enough for any event and holiday period. - No wiring required, fast and easy to install. - No more tangled mess of cords or searching for an outlet. - Orderly wrapped around a cardboard, convenient for reuse and storage. - Comes in a cardboard box, ready for gift giving. DEVOTED CUSTOMER SERVICE - This product comes with 1-MONTH full refund trial period and LIFE-TIME customer service - Genuine BRIGHT ZEAL home LED light products - Certified under UL588 and Complies with 16 CFR 1120.3(c) - TRADEMARK filed in U.S.A. - In business since 1997.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gLyJ3I+gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Zeal","source_asin":"B07ZYZ6FSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-176533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZYZ6FSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZYZ6FSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
