window.products.push({"id":176810,"name":"JulyPanny Soil Test Kit pH Moisture Meter Plant Water Light Tester Testing Kits for Garden Plants & Indoor & Outdoor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lghRsA-vL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"3-in-1 soil tester: 1.Light intensity Different environments have different light intensities, so you can check the daylight status of your soil at any time. 2.Acid-base strength Soil acid-base reaction directly affects plant growth and protects your soil acid-base balance at any time. 3.Moisture measurement Plant growth relies on soil moisture and nutrients, turning on the water source for your soil at any time. Features: 1.High-sensitivity probe, aluminum alloy probe link probe is inserted into the soil, inductively transmits parameters to the display 2.Large screen digital display indicating interface, long enough aluminum alloy probe to adapt to multiple soils. Tips: 1.The soil tester cannot be used for liquid detection. For soil containing stones, bark, and other debris, please use it carefully. Violent use will damage the electrode and affect the product life. 2.Wet the soil with water before inserting the soil. The probe should be inserted into the soil to a depth of 2/3 (more than 10cm) so that the measurement is more accurate. Just inserting the two probes is not effective and will not move. 3.Do not insert it in the soil for a long time to avoid damage. How To Use Step 1: Switch to moisture/pH/light position according to demand Step 2: Insert the probe into the soil about 2-4 inches . Step 3: Adjust the position of the probe until the pointer on the dial swing slightly . Step 4: Check moisture/pH/light level in the dial after 10 minutes and the pointer has stabilized. Step 5: Remove probe from soil and wipe clean after each use .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lghRsA-vL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JulyPanny","source_asin":"B08CGS7S5B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-176810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CGS7S5B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CGS7S5B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
