window.products.push({"id":176840,"name":"Leffora Custom 1.5mm Thick Crystal Clear Table Cover Protector 44 x 66 Inch Waterproof PVC Protective Table Pad Transparent Mat for Coffee Table, Dini","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MUXJTT1KL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Updated Version Clear - New upgraded material and manufacturing processes, high transparency furniture top protector. Great for dining table, coffee table, nightstand, wooden table, office desk, writing desk, computer desk, kitchen table, side table, dresser, transparent table, kids desk, countertop, TV bench. Protect your table, tablecloth and furniture tops against scratches, scuffs, stains, spillage, heating scalds. Easy to clean, Waterproof, Heat-resistant - 1.5mm thickness heavy duty, the clear table pad is recommended for kitchen and dining room table which has better heat resistant, maximum to 176°F/80°C. Use as table runner or placemats top cover mat, to better protect your table. Simply wipe it clean with a dishcloth or spray it with water. Applications - Clear type table protector may have air bubbles on white smooth finish or smooth glass tabletop, please purchase the Frosted type table protector, or put tablecloth under table protector, to avoid visible air bubbles. Before put table protector on lacquered or polished NEW wooden tops, please ensure painted oils dry enough, or put tablecloth under table protector, to keep your new wooden tabletop's painted oil breathing. Cut to fit - The table protector will be slightly bigger than actual size due to possible shrinkage and deviation consideration. They come with many different sizes and are able to cut to size. A sharp scissors, a pencil and a ruler are needed to make a perfect cut. Once you have these tools, you can customize your own tablecloth. If you need a custom size ,please go to Leffora storefront, find Have a question for Leffora? Click Ask a question to contact us for your customization request. Tips to make it flatten - Our table protectors are packaged in rolls to ensure no creases. Here tips to make it flat after you received: 1. Please roll the table pad in the opposite direction for few days; 2. Heating dryer blow or expose table protector under sunshine in minutes; 3. Put heavy items pressing on the pad's reverse-roll direction in days; 4. Use accessory tape dots to fix table protector in place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MUXJTT1KL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leffora","source_asin":"B07WHPKK9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-176840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WHPKK9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WHPKK9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
